From: acww-3ds export <noreply@invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Build system, helper tools and ignore rules

Changes 4 files of the decompilation for the 3DS port (area: build-system-and-tools).
Made by tools/export_from_fork.py; do not edit by hand.

